            Node("return_scalar", "return_scalar", "return scalar", "For the specified parameters, the following hypotheses imply the stated relation: (low : Bool) (a : Return) (D : ℝ) : wordScalar (returnWord low a) (coord low D)=coord low (run low a D)", DescribeRole.Theorem, AssessedProvenance.FromRepo()),
