            Node("actual_all_slots", "actual_all_slots", "actual all slots", "For every finite execution list and either anchor choice, construct the high and low actual finite-tail sources together. The retained literal tails, original source prefixes, all departure color slots, exact source scalars and closed word costs refer to this same pair.", DescribeRole.Theorem, AssessedProvenance.FromRepo()),
